{"metadata": {"team_id": "Organizers", "run_id": "orga-bm25-nopersonal", "run_type": "automatic"}, "turn_id": "6-2_6", "responses": [{"rank": 1, "text": "You can also try using a combination of two shampoos-one for your scalp and another for the length of your hair to get a better cleansing effect. Also, you can try adding Epsom salt to your regular shampoo to help eliminate excess oils on your hair strands and scalp with each wash. To prepare this hair treatment, mix equal parts of shampoo and Epsom salt, or add two tablespoons of Epsom salt for every 16 ounces of shampoo. Shake the shampoo bottle thoroughly after adding the salt and before every wash. When washing your hair, apply the Epsom salt and shampoo blend just like you do with regular shampoo, paying attention to the oiliest parts of your hair and scalp. It would be best if you only used Epsom salt-infused shampoo after every other regular shampooing to minimize the possibility of your hair and scalp drying out.", "citations": {"clueweb22-en0009-83-04895:6": 5.7438530921936035, "clueweb22-en0037-41-10440:5": 5.4796061515808105, "clueweb22-en0027-26-05299:7": 5.0477495193481445, "clueweb22-en0018-54-01822:10": 5.026843070983887, "clueweb22-en0025-00-10438:13": 4.813667297363281}, "ptkb_provenance": ["I frequently use heat styling tools to keep my hair looking good."]}], "references": {"clueweb22-en0009-83-04895:6": 5.7438530921936035, "clueweb22-en0037-41-10440:5": 5.4796061515808105, "clueweb22-en0027-26-05299:7": 5.0477495193481445, "clueweb22-en0018-54-01822:10": 5.026843070983887, "clueweb22-en0025-00-10438:13": 4.813667297363281, "clueweb22-en0017-46-13148:5": 4.727240562438965, "clueweb22-en0040-52-09315:12": 4.656436920166016, "clueweb22-en0022-05-01051:6": 4.632980823516846, "clueweb22-en0020-81-06334:6": 4.422370433807373, "clueweb22-en0001-78-15977:1": 4.409997940063477, "clueweb22-en0020-53-05239:1": 4.397363662719727, "clueweb22-en0044-18-15248:16": 4.3096489906311035, "clueweb22-en0009-06-16757